/** @page sshtypedcontracts Typed Contract Reference

    @tableofcontents

    @section sshtypedcontractindex Typed Contract Index

    This page summarizes all public typed hashes used by the ssh binary module
    and its qlib helper modules.

    @subsection sshtypedcontractindexbinary Binary-Module Typed Hashes

    The following tables list the typed hashes declared in the
    @ref Qore::Ssh "Qore::Ssh" namespace, grouped by functional domain.

    <b>Server Configuration</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshServerConfig "SshServerConfig"|top-level server configuration with listeners, callbacks, and providers
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshListenerConfig "SshListenerConfig"|per-listener bind, auth, security, and keepalive configuration

    <b>Server Status</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshServerStatus "SshServerStatus"|server runtime status with per-listener detail
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshListenerStatus "SshListenerStatus"|individual listener runtime status
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshActiveSessionInfo "SshActiveSessionInfo"|active session info with byte counters and SFTP operation count

    <b>Session and Authentication</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshSessionInfo "SshSessionInfo"|SSH session metadata including identity, address, and policy
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshAuthContextInfo "SshAuthContextInfo"|authentication context with method, credentials, and metadata
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshAuthDecision "SshAuthDecision"|authentication decision with principal, policy, and partial-auth support

    <b>Command Contract</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshCommandRequest "SshCommandRequest"|command/subsystem request with identity and routing metadata
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SshCommandResult "SshCommandResult"|command result with exit status, stdout/stderr, and result data

    <b>SFTP Session</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpSessionInfo "SftpSessionInfo"|SFTP session metadata wrapping SSH session info
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpProtocolMessage "SftpProtocolMessage"|raw SFTP protocol message envelope
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpTransferRequest "SftpTransferRequest"|file transfer request for publish/retrieve workflows
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpTransferInfo "SftpTransferInfo"|transfer state tracking for atomic publish workflows
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpTransferDecision "SftpTransferDecision"|transfer allow/deny decision

    <b>SFTP Backend: Path and Listing</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpPathRequest "SftpPathRequest"|path operation request (stat, rmdir, mkdir, removePath)
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpPathInfo "SftpPathInfo"|stat result with type, size, permissions, and symlink info
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpListResult "SftpListResult"|directory listing result

    <b>SFTP Backend: Handle I/O</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpOpenRequest "SftpOpenRequest"|open request for read or write
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpOpenResult "SftpOpenResult"|open result with optional eager data or backend handle
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpReadRequest "SftpReadRequest"|streamed read request with offset and length
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpReadResult "SftpReadResult"|streamed read result with data and EOF flag
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpWriteRequest "SftpWriteRequest"|streamed write request with offset and data
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpCloseRequest "SftpCloseRequest"|close request for read or write handles

    <b>SFTP Backend: Mutations and Operations</b>

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpRenameRequest "SftpRenameRequest"|rename request with source and destination paths
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpSubmissionRequest "SftpSubmissionRequest"|file submission request with inline data or source path
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpOperationRequest "SftpOperationRequest"|completion and mutation request with explicit completion mode
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpOperationResult "SftpOperationResult"|operation result with path, status, and transfer info
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpSymlinkRequest "SftpSymlinkRequest"|symlink creation request
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpSetstatRequest "SftpSetstatRequest"|setstat/fsetstat request with attribute fields
    |@ref Qore::Ssh::SftpStatvfsResult "SftpStatvfsResult"|statvfs result for the @c statvfs\@openssh.com extension

    @subsection sshtypedcontractflags Binary-Module Restriction And Flag Targets

    @anchor RET_VALUE_ONLY
    @anchor CONSTANT

    The following stable targets are used by the generated binary-module API
    docs:

    |!Symbol|!Description
    |@ref Qore::PO_NO_NETWORK "Qore::PO_NO_NETWORK"|module operations that require network access
    |@ref Qore::PO_NO_FILESYSTEM "Qore::PO_NO_FILESYSTEM"|module operations that require filesystem access
    |@ref RET_VALUE_ONLY "RET_VALUE_ONLY"|method metadata flag used for return-value-only accessors
    |@ref CONSTANT "CONSTANT"|method metadata flag used for non-mutating accessors
*/
